 **Algorithm Steps:**
 
-1. **Initialize Error Calculation:**
-   Start from the highest resolution level (leaf nodes) and proceed bottom-up [S1]. Do not visit tree nodes directly; instead, visit only the dividing point table [S1].
+1.  **Initialize Error Calculation:**
